stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    [*] --> Pending : create() — reviewStatus defaults to "Pending" (touchCreated)

    Pending --> Approved : PATCH /justifications/{id}/review (reviewedBy, reviewedAt, resolutionNotes)
    Pending --> Rejected : PATCH /justifications/{id}/review (reviewedBy, reviewedAt, resolutionNotes)

    Approved --> Rejected : review() again — allowed, there is no ordering guard
    Rejected --> Approved : review() again — allowed, there is no ordering guard

    note right of Pending
        The only guarded transition is the target: reviewStatus=Pending is
        rejected with "Cannot review to Pending". The current state is never
        checked, so a resolved justification can be flipped either way.
    end note

    note right of Approved
        Publishing an event and flipping attendance_record.attendance_status
        to "Justified" are NOT part of review() — approval does not cascade.
        requires_attachment is not enforced server-side before approval.
    end note

    Pending --> [*] : DELETE (physical delete)
    Approved --> [*] : DELETE (physical delete)
    Rejected --> [*] : DELETE (physical delete)
